  "description": "Mediocre grades. No specialty. Nothing I want to do.  \n \nYou're on the cusp of eighteen, about to start your senior year, and you're going through a full-blown \"reality check.\" The meteor night is long.  \n \nEverything seems to be off to a different start than your best friend, and your glamorous childhood seems like a dream you'll never have again. The more you think about it, the more self-defeating your thoughts become, and the deeper and darker the night gets. The night finally arrives, and as he escapes his noisy family, he encounters a peculiar-looking girl, Dawn, at a convenience store.  \n \nThe next day, she reappears as a new student in Yoo-sung's class. Even a double...!  \n \nDawn, who seems to be out of touch with reality. As they become friends, Yu-sung's time, which was stopped at night. gradually begins to flow towards the dawn!  \n \nHowever, Dawn soon realizes that she too trapped in the deep night...  \n \nThis is a story about how we overcome the night to the dawn.  \n \nHow to love the dawn!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%83%88%EB%B2%BD%EC%9D%84-%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95/3729), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62473886)",
